-- source:
--   Sound case split of root-connected theorem 2ee0a416-57f4-4989-950a-a0e286d2e712. Original finite cap cash estimate; branch on X.ν (Iio 0) = ⊤. Requires original martingale/Stieltjes proof, no artificial centring assumptions.

